orto -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block reverse\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/MKPMAOPUNHOMASC.png?v=1791980367\" alt=\"Camisa ArmorX Brk Fishing Branca com Proteção UV50+\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288 32c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32V240H64c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32h128v208c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32V304h160c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32H288V32z\"/></svg> Performance & Conforto</span>\n      <h3 class=\"brk-desc-title\">PROTEÇÃO SOLAR UV50+ COM SECAGEM ULTRA RÁPIDA</h3>\n      <p class=\"brk-desc-paragraph\">Confeccionada em tecido tecnológico de absorção instantânea de suor, bloqueia até 98% dos raios UVA e UVB, mantendo a sensação de frescor e conforto térmico mesmo sob sol intenso o dia todo.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Ato 3: Punho com Luva Integrada & Acabamento -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/COSTAS_MASC_6e018540-6d4f-4866-943c-f7fec13554cb.png?v=1791980359\" alt=\"Camisa ArmorX Brk Fishing Branca com Proteção UV50+\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 0c4.6 0 9.2 1 13.4 2.9L467.7 92.8c24.3 10.8 39.8 35.1 39.8 61.7c0 144.6-74.4 290.3-238.5 354.9c-8.2 3.2-1