 -->\n  <div class=\"brk-quick-badges\">\n    <div class=\"brk-badge-item\">\n      <span class=\"brk-badge-icon\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M480 32c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v96L149.3 458.7c-18.7 18.7-49.1 18.7-67.9 0L37.5 414.8c-18.7-18.7-18.7-49.1 0-67.9L304 80V32H480z\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"brk-badge-content\">\n        <strong class=\"brk-badge-title\">Aço Especial Nobre</strong>\n        <span class=\"brk-badge-sub\">Alta Retenção de Fio</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-badge-item\">\n      <span class=\"brk-badge-icon\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M495.9 166.6c3.2 8.7 .5 18.4-6.4 24.6l-43.3 39.4c1.1 8.3 1.7 16.8 1.7 25.4s-.6 17.1-1.7 25.4l43.3 39.4c6.9 6.2 9.6 15.9 6.4 24.6c-4.4 11.9-9.7 23.3-15.8 34.3l-4.7 8.1c-6.6 11-14 21.4-22.1 31.2c-5.9 7.2-15.7 9.6-24.5 6.8l-55.7-17.7c-13.4 10.3-28.2 18.9-44 25.4l-12.5 57.1c-2 9.1-9 16.3-18.2 17.8c-13.8 2.3-28 3.5-42.5 3.5s-28.7-1.2-42.5-3.5c-9.2-1.5-16.2-8.7-18.2-17.8l-12.5-57.1c-15.8-6.5-30.6-15.1-44-25.4L83.1 425.9c-8.8 2.8-18.6 .3-24.5-6.8c-8.1-9.8-15.5-20.2-22.1-31.2l-4.7-8.1c-6.1-11-11.4-22.4-15.8-34.3c-3.2-8.7-.5-18.4 6.4-24.6l43.3-39.4C64.6 273.1 64 264.6 64 256s.6-17.1 1.7-25.4L22.4 191.2c-6.9-6.2-9.6-15.9-6.4-24.6c4.4-11.9 9.7-23.3 15.8-34.3l4.7-8.1c6.6-11 14-21.4 22.1-31.2c5.9-7.2 15.7-9.6 24.5-6.8l55.7 17.7c13.4-10.3 28.2-18.9 44-25.4l12.5-57.1c2-9.1 9-16.3 18.2-17.8C227.3 1.2 241.5 0 256 0s28.7 1.2 42.5 3.5c9.2 1.5 16.2 8.7 18.2 17.8l12.5 57.1c15.8 6.5 30.6 15.1 44 25.4l55.7-17.7c8.8-2.8 18.6-.3 24.5 6.8c8.1 9.8 15.5 20.2 22.1 31.2l4.7 8.1c6.1 11 11.4 22.4 15.8 34.3zM256 336a80 80 0 1 0 0-160 80 80 0 1 0 0 160z\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"brk-badge-content\">\n        <strong class=\"brk-badge-title\">Tratamento Térmico</strong>\n        <span class=\"brk-badge-sub\">Dureza e Tenacidade</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-badge-item\">\n      <span class=\"brk-badge-icon\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 0c4.6 0 9.2 1 13.4 2.9L467.7 92.8c24.3 10.8 39.8 35.1 39.8 61.7c0 144.6-74.4 290.3-238.5 354.9c-8.2 3.2-17.3 3.2-25.5 0C79.4 444.8 5 299.1 5 154.5c0-26.6 15.5-50.9 39.8-61.7L242.6 2.9C246.8 1 251.4 0 256 0z\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"brk-badge-content\">\n        <strong class=\"brk-badge-title\">Acabamento Artesanal</strong>\n        <span class=\"brk-badge-sub\">Cabo Anatômico Nobre</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-badge-item\">\n      <span class=\"brk-badge-icon\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 0l40 160 160 40-160 40-40 160-40-160-160-40 160-40 40-160z\"/></svg></span>\n      <div class=\"brk-badge-content\">\n        <strong class=\"brk-badge-title\">Garantia BRK</strong>\n        <span class=\"brk-badge-sub\">Procedência Garantida</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 3 Atos Narrativos de Alta Conversão -->\n  \n  <!-- Ato 1: Lâmina 10\" Multifuncional em Inox -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/1790170725452-1.jpg?v=1791553188\" alt=\"Faca Brk Pescaria 10&quot; Resina Transparente com Isca\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M480 32c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v96L149.3 458.7c-18.7 18.7-49.1 18.7-67.9 0L37.5 414.8c-18.7-18.7-18.7-49.1 0-67.9L304 80V32H480z\"/></svg> Lâmina 10\" Multifuncional em Inox</span>\n      <h3 class=\"brk-desc-title\">AÇO INOX ESCOVADO COM DORSO MOSQUEADO, ABRIDOR E GRAVAÇÃO PESCARIA</h3>\n      <p class=\"brk-desc-paragraph\">Uma peça de destaque absoluto para pescadores e churrasqueiros: a Faca Brk Pescaria 10\" Resina Transparente com Isca possui lâmina robusta de 10 polegadas em aço inoxidável escovado com dorso mosqueado, abridor de garrafas integrado, gancho frontal e gravação temática 'PESCARIA'.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Ato 2: Cabo Exclusivo com Isca Encapsulada -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block reverse\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/1790170725452-3.jpg?v=1791553188\" alt=\"Faca Brk Pescaria 10&quot; Resina Transparente com Isca\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320 64c-70.7 0-136.2 30.1-182.2 81.3C104.4 184.2 64 240 64 240s40.4 55.8 73.8 94.7C183.8 385.9 249.3 416 320 416c106 0 192-86 192-192S426 64 320 64zm-64 128a32 32 0 1 1 0 64 32 32 0 0 1 0-64zM96 256c0-10.7 2.1-20.9 6-30.2L16 144v224l86-81.8c-3.9-9.3-6-19.5-6-30.2z\"/></svg> Cabo Exclusivo com Isca Encapsulada</span>\n      <h3 class=\"brk-desc-title\">EMPUNHADURA ARTÍSTICA EM MADEIRA NOBRE E RESINA COM ISCA ARTIFICIAL</h3>\n      <p class=\"brk-desc-paragraph\">O grande diferencial está no cabo anatômico híbrido confeccionado em madeira nobre e resina cristalina transparente de alto brilho, trazendo uma autêntica isca artificial encapsulada em 3D no interior do cabo.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Ato 3: Bainha Protetora em Couro -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/1790170725452-4.jpg?v=1791553189\" alt=\"Faca Brk Pescaria 10&quot; Resina Transparente com Isca\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 0l40 160 160 40-160 40-40 160-40-160-160-40 160-40 40-160z\"/></svg> Bainha Protetora em Couro</span>\n      <h3 class=\"brk-desc-title\">ACOMPANHA BAINHA EM COURO COSTURADO COM TRAVA DE BOTÃO DE PRESSÃO</h3>\n      <p class=\"brk-desc-paragraph\">Acompanha bainha protetora sob medida em couro legítimo com costura perimetral em linha encerada, passador de cinto e presilha com botão de pressão que mantém a faca segura no transporte.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Box de Especificacoes e Cuidados -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-specs-box\">\n    <h4 class=\"brk-desc-specs-title\">\n      <span class=\"brk-title-icon\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M384 48V64c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32H160c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32V48C57.3 48 0 105.3 0 176V448c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H384c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V176c0-70.