r -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/246708f34b714adb975e4f56237d4841_2FproductOnChannel_2Fimages_2F186665731_2Fc735f3da3a53418798b1083fb064b15d.png?v=1790164048\" alt=\"BRK Faca Brasil 10&quot; Resina com Abridor\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0;\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M480 32c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v96L149.3 458.7c-18.7 18.7-49.1 18.7-67.9 0L37.5 414.8c-18.7-18.7-18.7-49.1 0-67.9L304 80V32H480z\"/></svg> Lâmina 10\" em Inox com Abridor</span>\n      <h3 class=\"brk-desc-title\">AÇO INOXIDÁVEL ESCOVADO COM DORSO MOSQUEADO E ABRIDOR INTEGRADO</h3>\n      <p class=\"brk-desc-paragraph\">Projetada para unir alta performance de corte e design colecionável no churrasco, a BRK Faca Brasil 10\" Resina com Abridor conta com lâmina de 10 polegadas (aprox. 26 cm) em aço inox escovado, dorso mosqueado, abridor de garrafas integrado e identidade Brasil na lâmina e cabo exclusivo em madeira e resina.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- Ato 2: Cabo Híbrido em Madeira & Resina -->\n  <div class=\"brk-desc-block reverse\">\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-media\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0887/2083/4857/files/246708f34b714adb975e4f56237d4841_2FproductOnChannel_2Fimages_2F186665731_2F1ae293cb6d3949229507445ca903d7d2.png?v=1790164048\" alt=\"BRK Faca Brasil 10&quot; Resina com Abridor\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n      </div>\n    <div class=\"brk-desc-text\">\n      <span class=\"brk-desc-tag\"><svg class=\"brk-svg-icon\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" fill=\"#16a34a\" style=\"display:inline-block;v